; Setup's own texts, in each of the app's interface languages (the [Languages]
; section of videohighlighter-packs.iss). Inno Setup translates its standard
; wizard pages itself; these are the texts this Setup adds. %1, %2 and %3 are
; filled in by the script, %n is a line break. A message missing from a
; language falls back to English, so add a new one to every language.

[CustomMessages]

